```cpp
#include <iostream>
using namespace std;
int main()
{
  int h, min, sec;
  cout << "Enter the number of hours: " << endl;
  cin >> h;
  min = h * 60;
  sec = min * 60;
  cout << h << " hours = " << min << " minutes = " << sec << " seconds";
  return 0;
}
```

Ввод 2 → `2 hours = 120 minutes = 7200 seconds`.

```cpp
float price, percentage, discount;
cout << "Entering the price of the product: " << endl;
cin >> price;
cout << "Entering a discount percentage: " << endl;
cin >> percentage;
discount = price * (percentage / 100);
cout << "Display discount: " << discount << "\n";
```

Цена 2000, скидка 10 % → `Display discount: 200`.

